window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Fear pounds through me every time I approach the man in room #526.</b></p> <p>But I put on my big girl panties and deal because I'm a nurse, and helping people is all that matters.</p> <p>I moved across country to a hell mouth with my fiancé who then dumped me. But I found a new job, got a new apartment, and the new me isn't going to be cowed down by some big, scary guy. Even if he is becoming more monster than man.</p> <p>Leonidas is chained up in our research hospital for everyone's safety, since he's been infected by a demon.</p> <p>This man has no last name, no past, but plenty of secrets. He insists he's a Knight of the Light, with powers to fight the forces of darkness, and we are holding him captive. But I can't let him go, he needs help. The sickness is changing him, turning him into something dark and dangerous.</p> <p>Then when the demon who infected Leonidas escapes and starts razing a bloody path through the hospital, I have only this knight to rely on if we want to get out alive.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
